{"parse":{"title":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·一","pageid":3192,"revid":6767,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%B8%80&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%B8%80&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%B8%80&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·一</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.90.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E7.BA.AA.E4.BA.8B.E7.B0.BF.E3.80.91.E9.AA.91.E5.A3.AB.E5.90.8C.E7.9B.9F.E7.AF.87.C2.B7.E4.B8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·一\">【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·一</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%B8%80&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·一\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-19 15:18<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FS5FCZBMkm76p9H_gGw2r3Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S5FCZBMkm76p9H_gGw2r3Q</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>各位团长好！<br />\n今天给大家带来的是<br />\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>骑士诸国同盟</b></font>的介绍<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息249.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"154\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1112\" /><img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>骑士同盟<font color=\"blue\"><b>体系庞大</b></font>，由<font color=\"blue\"><b>13个骑士团国</b></font>组成。对外，拥有着强大的<font color=\"blue\"><b>力量与地位</b></font>。<br />然而，在长达数十年间，其<font color=\"blue\"><b>内部领土冲突</b></font>不断。多个骑士团国在斗争中<font color=\"blue\"><b>惨遭毁灭</b></font>。最终，大家期望平息内斗，调节矛盾，<font color=\"blue\"><b>骑士评议会</b></font>应运而生...<br /><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息250.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/49njwek35c2dm5n1k1jwivalwryshol.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF250.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"747\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/49njwek35c2dm5n1k1jwivalwryshol.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF250.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/49njwek35c2dm5n1k1jwivalwryshol.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF250.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1613\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n骑士联盟的<font color=\"blue\"><b>内部战乱</b></font>暂且告一段落<br />\n然而在<font color=\"blue\"><b>大洋对侧</b></font><br />\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>新的势力</b></font>正在崛起...\n<br /><br />\n骑士同盟应该如何应对呢？<br />\n敬请期待<font color=\"blue\"><b>【骑士同盟篇·二】</b></font>\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022062856\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2398/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.577      1 -total\n 56.30%   18.342      1 模板:面包屑\n 43.40%   14.138      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3192-0!